---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About"
  description="What PickLoot is and how we choose the products we cover."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About PickLoot</h1>
    <p>
      PickLoot is an independent product research and comparison site. We dig
      through bestseller lists, spec sheets, and real buyer feedback so you can
      decide whether something is actually worth buying — without scrolling
      through hundreds of listings yourself.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every guide is built around one question: is this genuinely a good pick for
      the price, or is it just well-marketed? We compare alternatives, call out
      trade-offs, and link directly to the product so you can check current
      pricing and availability.
    </p>
    <h2>How we research and pick products</h2>
    <p>
      We compare specs, cross-reference bestseller rankings, and read through
      public buyer reviews looking for patterns — not single reviews. We don't
      claim hands-on testing unless a guide says so explicitly. The full
      process, including who writes our guides and how often we update them,
      is on our <a href="/editorial-policy">editorial policy</a> page.
    </p>
    <h2>How we make money</h2>
    <p>
      PickLoot is reader-supported. When you buy something through one of our
      links, we may earn a small commission from the retailer at no extra cost
      to you. This never affects which products we choose to feature or how we
      rate them. Full details are on our <a href="/disclaimer">affiliate disclosure</a> page.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions, corrections, or a product you think we should cover? Reach out
      on the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
